        ecrm:P41_classified  <http://data.silknow.org/object/a6b972a6-472c-344d-af4c-02a8826a3ae9> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/a6b972a6-472c-344d-af4c-02a8826a3ae9/domain/1>
